    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brothers Kebab Saloon</strong> is a fantastic storytelling horror game where you don't wander around in the dark with a flashlight in hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this retro-looking game where you will learn how to make kebabs from scratch, you need to pay attention to customers' orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FPS</strong> and <strong>Single Player</strong> game, set in the 1990s, psychological horror game genre, atmosphere and a work that will draw you in and leave you wondering with its story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic camera effect. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues with NPCs. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumpscares and tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Object crafting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740070/extras/9ec86f9764f9a5c2fc49a786a95c717b.poster.avif?t=1748948877\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740070/extras/9ec86f9764f9a5c2fc49a786a95c717b.webm?t=1748948877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740070/extras/9ec86f9764f9a5c2fc49a786a95c717b.mp4?t=1748948877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Walk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E - Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Mouse Click - Cutting Doner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no pause menu and exit button. If you want to leave use\u00a0\u00a0&quot;alt+f4&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740070/extras/8d8af2c46dae57500cf192c8b90c1c7a.poster.avif?t=1748948877\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740070/extras/8d8af2c46dae57500cf192c8b90c1c7a.webm?t=1748948877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740070/extras/8d8af2c46dae57500cf192c8b90c1c7a.mp4?t=1748948877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Thanks in advance to those who played our game that fully explains the psychological horror game!</i></p>",
